{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲清楚解释了‘满足生出延续愿望→用力抓紧反而增加牵动→热切退下后身体松动、牵挂却留下孤单’的因果链，但对共同体验为何突然变成有距离的过去，以及身体为何恰在此刻松开，交代得较简略。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙具体解释了饱满感退去如何暴露未解的悬念、共同亲近如何转成带有时间距离的孤单，以及身体放松为何不等于感情消退，但‘期待没有造成伤害所以解除防备’略显补设前情，也弱化了抓紧反而加剧牵动的反馈机制。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙虽然不如甲集中地呈现‘越抓越悬、于是松手’的因果链，但它对当下失去支撑的触发条件、从共同体验退回独自感受的转折，以及身体解除紧绷后仍然牵挂的机制给出了更具体的解释，因此局部推因偏弱尚不构成实质退步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2282afd3-687c-45e8-9816-57c79a6349fa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133146763738Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:33:18.326607+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9bde686a3f7888b56724aeb4aaf5ce261f812700fe2f1cba90264c72ca786dab", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850000